## Abstract-Reported Findings

These statements require verification against the full text and source data before inclusion in reference annotations.

- All selected siRNA-loaded formulations had particle sizes below 150 nm.
- SM-102- and CKK-E12-based formulations achieved relative S100P expression levels of 0.0744 and 0.0611, respectively.
- CKK-E12-based LNPs showed higher lung biodistribution signals than the other three ionizable lipid groups.

